                <pb facs="0982" n="838" xml:id="pg838"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.113 Radio/18: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-06-07T20:00:00-04:00">June 7, 1929—8
                    p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>187. Your 448, June 5, 5 p.m. The Legation may act on its own discretion.
                    Department suggests that further representations may be withheld unless specific
                    complaints are received from importers. Keep Department informed.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
